<content>
  <section><para>The functions describing the time that baseballs stayed in the air, in seconds, that four baseball players hit are below.</para>
<list>
  <item>\(f(t)=(-16t-1)(t-5)\)</item>
  <item>\(g(t)=(-16t-1)(t-10)\)</item>
  <item>\(h(t)=(t-7)(-16t-1)\)</item>
  <item>\(p(t)=(-8t-1)(2t-5)\)</item>
</list>
<para>Which function represents the ball that stayed in the air the longest?</para></section>
</content>
